        <h3>Where February 1 Fell in Each Run</h3>
        <p>The weeks split three ways:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>{{N_FIRST}} songs were in their first and only week at number one: "I Want You Back," "Superstition," "You're Sixteen," "Laughter in the Rain," "Love Rollercoaster" and "Car Wash."</li>
          <li>{{N_MID}} were in the middle of a longer run: "Knock Three Times," "American Pie" and "Le Freak."</li>
          <li>{{N_LAST}} was in the last week of its run: "Baby Come Back."</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Test Your Own Memory</h3>
        <p>Which of these ten February 1 in music history number ones would you have bet on?</p>
        <p>The list runs from the Jackson 5 in 1970 to Chic in 1979.</p>
        <p>Other weeks have their own lists, including <a href="/blog/trivia/september-16-in-music-history/">September 16 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/august-19-in-music-history/">August 19 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/july-15-in-music-history/">July 15 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/june-12-in-music-history/">June 12 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/may-29-in-music-history/">May 29 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/april-17-in-music-history/">April 17 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/march-20-in-music-history/">March 20 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/february-13-in-music-history/">February 13 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/january-9-in-music-history/">January 9 in music history</a>, <a href="/blog/trivia/november-28-in-music-history/">November 28 in music history</a> and <a href="/blog/trivia/this-week-in-music-history-october-24/">this week in music history for October 24</a>.</p>
        <p>The <a href="/pages/70s-trivia-quiz">70s Music Trivia Quiz</a> has ten new questions each round.</p>
        <p>For the whole decade at the top, see the <a href="/blog/songs/70s-number-one-hits/">70s number one hits</a> page.</p>
        <p>More of the decade lives on the <a href="/">Music of the 70s</a> home page.</p>

